the themes and mechanics somewhat, but it's still recognizable as Changeling: The Lost. It doesn't invalidate the version Rose heads, and it would constructively put to use Hill's content.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-31T02:10:23-07:00","id":1135700,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taidragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1130544-changeling-kickstarter-pushed-back-to-2018-no-it-s-2017?p=1135690#post1135690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't see why that would be a bad idea; it could be a setting hack, much like the ones in the Demon Storyteller Guide. The content changes a bit, the themes and mechanics somewhat, but it's still recognizable as Changeling: The Lost. It doesn't invalidate the version Rose heads, and it would constructively put to use Hill's content.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree. I think you've all got a great idea here. I'm glad that we've got so much of the Underhill version to work with. That should hypothetically make it fairly simple to adjust, since both versions would be second edition compatible already.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-31T03:44:42-07:00","id":1135723,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taidragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1130544-changeling-kickstarter-pushed-back-to-2018-no-it-s-2017?p=1135690#post1135690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't see why that would be a bad idea; it could be a setting hack, much like the ones in the Demon Storyteller Guide. The content changes a bit, the themes and mechanics somewhat, but it's still recognizable as Changeling: The Lost. It doesn't invalidate the version Rose heads, and it would constructively put to use Hill's content.</div> </div> </div> </div> Exactly what I was going for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-31T15:06:44-07:00","id":1135950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taidragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1130544-changeling-kickstarter-pushed-back-to-2018-no-it-s-2017?p=1135690#post1135690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't see why that would be a bad idea; it could be a setting hack, much like the ones in the Demon Storyteller Guide. The content changes a bit, the themes and mechanics somewhat, but it's still recognizable as Changeling: The Lost. It doesn't invalidate the version Rose heads, and it would constructively put to use Hill's content.</div> </div> </div> </div>The only hiccup would be either paying someone who has rather angrily left the company for his work belatedly, or copying it closely enough to please the fans without giving Hill credit or pay.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-31T15:23:12-07:00","id":1135958,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1130544-changeling-kickstarter-pushed-back-to-2018-no-it-s-2017?p=1135950#post1135950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The only hiccup would be either paying someone who has rather angrily left the company for his work belatedly, or copying it closely enough to please the fans without giving Hill credit or pay.</div> </div> </div> </div> Taidragon wasn't suggesting putting it in a Changeling Storyteller guide, he was suggesting use could use it in a simular way. <br /> <br /> And David Hill only stepped down as Changeling Dev, he said he is still willing to write for Oynx Path. <br /> <br /> And its likely he has been or will be payed for his work anyways, since its clear from the previews that some of David Hill's work has been included.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 08-31-2017, 06:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-31T16:39:29-07:00","id":1135995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1130544-changeling-kickstarter-pushed-back-to-2018-no-it-s-2017?p=1135958#post1135958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And David Hill only stepped down as Changeling Dev, he said he is still willing to write for Oynx Path.<br /> <br /> And its likely he has been or will be payed for his work anyways, since its clear from the previews that some of David Hill's work has been included.</div> </div> </div> </div>As always when this topic comes up, I'm prefacing this with I'm not taking sides, I'm not assigning blame, and I'm not interested in a debate.<br /> <br /> While these statements were initially true, both of those bridges seem to have been mutually burned. I'd say there are better chances of President Oompa-Loompa getting his ratings up to 80% than David working with OPP again. I do have my theories as to what went down, but speculation is kinda pointless and I don't want to derail the thread talking about hypotheses that aren't worth the data they are encoded on. Suffice to say, this is like your two best friends who were dating breaking up with each other messily. Everyone wants and hopes that things can go back to they way they were, you hate that they hate each other's guts and want that to stop, but the damage has been done and there's no going back.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 08-31-2017, 08:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-31T18:03:04-07:00","id":1136018,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1130544-changeling-kickstarter-pushed-back-to-2018-no-it-s-2017?p=1135950#post1135950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The only hiccup would be either paying someone who has rather angrily left the company for his work belatedly, or copying it closely enough to please the fans without giving Hill credit or pay.</div> </div> </div> </div>You assume OPP would publish something of Hill for profit now? That would be hilariously irresponsible and grounds for amazing litigation. What was proposed was basically a fan project.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-02T13:47:46-07:00","id":1136705,"title":"","content":"Hey guys,can you help figure something kith related? I noticed the Kith <i>Helldiver </i>being mentioned in the storyteller preview. I'm trying to figure out what his kith could be? 'i've tried seeing the definition of the world helldiver,and only found out about another game","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 09-02-2017, 04:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-02T16:59:31-07:00","id":1136758,"title":"","content":"I'm curious about this as well. My current expectation is that it will be an explorer or a spelunker, given that the preview mentioned a Bright One lighting the way. I was quite excited to see two new kiths in that preview. It makes me wonder how many we will actually be getting in the core.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\